OL,3,GNEWSATwo charged with human trafficking
OL,4,Ain shoplifting crackdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been charged with human
OL,7,Ftrafficking offences in Glasgow as part
OL,8,Fof action to tackle retail crime.
OL,10,FPolice Scotland said vulnerable young
OL,11,Fpeople were being targeted to steal
OL,12,Falcohol from shops across the west of
OL,13,FScotland.
OL,15,FA 62-year-old man and a 61-year-old
OL,16,Fwoman were arrested as part of
OL,17,FOperation Dynos, and they are due to
OL,18,Fappear at Glasgow Sheriff Court on
OL,19,FFriday.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
