OL,3,GNEWSATwo charged with human trafficking
OL,4,Ain shoplifting crackdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FA total of nine adults have been
OL,7,Farrested in connection with the
OL,8,Fcriminal exploitation of children and
OL,9,Fyoung people since the operation began
OL,10,Fin April 2025.
